# Contact form endpoint (optional).
#
# Set this to a form service endpoint that accepts a JSON POST, e.g. Formspree
# (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx) or Web3Forms, and the contact form submits
# in place. Leave it unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail
# client with the message pre-filled.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
